roup_delete's up-front refusal have no automated test", "recommendation": "Scope: instance. EditTransaction.CanRemove/NotInDocumentError live in host-coupled EditTransaction.cs, which the test project does not link, so the new branch in GhCanvasTool delete pass 1 (and group_delete's check) is exercised only by reading. The predicate is a single ReferenceEquals over Grasshopper types, so a host-free extraction would buy little. No edit wanted now; if VRF-024 is extended, an orphan case belongs there.", "about": {"review_id": "rev-20261111T193532Z-17d00961", "fid": "R-5"}, "oid": "O-1"}, {"goal": "Nothing Is Broken", "title": "The 'unparseable colour read as not given' pattern survives in Rhino-side tools outside this branch", "recommendation": "Scope: class (R-2 was scoped to the two group sites, which are fixed). The same reason holds at RhinoSceneTool.Layers.cs L98 and L156 and RhinoRenderTool.Materials.cs L281 and L407, where `if (TryParseColor(...))` silently skips an invalid colour under success. Search: `if (ToolHelpers.TryParseColor(` without a negation. ParseHelpers.TryParseOptionalColor is now the construction those sites could pass through. Not part of this branch's scope; no edit wanted here.", "about": {"review_id": "rev-20261111T193532Z-17d00961", "fid": "R-2"}, "oid": "O-2"}], "duration_seconds": 420, "scope": "edit-transaction", "scope_chosen_by": "binding", "scope_unresolved_cause": null, "scope_reason": null, "base_extended_from": null, "chunks": [], "chunks_proposed": [], "chunk": null, "base_reviewed": null, "record_lint": {"records": [".prawduct/artifacts/build-plan-edit-transaction.md", ".prawduct/artifacts/project-preferences.md", ".prawduct/changes/edit-transaction.md", "CHANGELOG.md", "src/Cordyceps/Knowledge/CommonErrorsGuide.md"], "chunk_graded": null, "chunks_graded": [], "plan_graded": null, "findings": [], "unchecked": [], "counts": {"chunk-ref-missing": null, "governed-by-gap": 0, "suite-total-claim": 0, "learnings-over-budget": 0, "lear